 "PALADIN": {
  "//": "The Paladin (Battle Re-work Part 8). DEVOTION, its meter (pl.devotion -- lasts the hunt, fades at home): perRound, perBlock, and take x (damage taken / max health). bash: the shield bash -- damage [least, most] plus your shield's defence / bashDef, stuns 1 round (diminishing returns, a boss's half), then cooldown rounds. twin: each blow with a sword in both hands (two a round, no shield). xpSplit: a kill's xp to Attack and Defence half each (the plan: 'Trains Attack and Defence'). layHeal: Lay on hands heals this much of your health. aegis: rounds Aegis blocks everything. undead: who Smite and holy water hit hardest.",
